this week in AI:

@Cyera is paying $1B to secure the identities of AI agents, not humans, after acquiring Oasis Security.

@AnthropicAI just picked up Sui co-founder Sam Blackshear from Mysten Labs to work on defensive AI security.

AMD and Nvidia each committed $5B to Anthropic and Sutskever’s Safe Superintelligence, hedging against single-vendor chip dependence.

and US and EU AI regulation just split further apart, one legislating state by state, the other buying itself 16 more months.
